\f0\b\fs36 \cf2 Relationship explanation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 One customer can place zero, one, or many orders. Each order can reference one customer through 
\f2\fs26 orders.customer_id
\f1\fs24 , although the current schema permits that field to be null.\
The 
\f2\fs26 products
\f1\fs24  table stores product information and stock quantities. A relationship between products and orders has not yet been implemented or verified.\
This diagram documents the current implementation and will be updated if the database design is extended.\
